  "selection": "Two most recent submissions per category from the arXiv API (sortBy=submittedDate, sortOrder=descending) across physics.chem-ph, cond-mat.mtrl-sci, cs.CL, eess.IV and math.NA, skipping entries arXiv had not yet rendered to PDF and taking the next in that category. A rule, not a taste: re-running the same queries reproduces the selection method, and nothing about the files was inspected before freezing.",
